# The voice tool's direct Python dependencies (Python 3.12). requirements.txt pins these and
# everything they pull in, with a hash for every file. To update, follow the checklist in
# docs/security.md, then take only versions at least a week old:
#   uv pip compile requirements.in --generate-hashes --no-annotate --python-version 3.12 \
#     --exclude-newer <the date a week ago> -o requirements.txt
